Package: gelimo
Title: High-Performance Generalized Phylogenetic Linear Models in Rust
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Héctor Jesús", "López-Ordaz", email = "hectorjl@lcg.unam.mx", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: High-throughput Generalized Phylogenetic Linear Models (PGLS) engine
    compatible with 'caper' and optimized with Rust and Rayon for genome-wide
    OrthoFinder orthogroup screening.
